{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Pierre a un entretien d'embauche", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Se pr\u00e9parer pour un entretien d'embauche", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 5, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 8, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A1.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "L'apprenant \u00e9change de l'information sur des consignes concernant des activit\u00e9s simples et la s\u00e9curit\u00e9 sur le lieu de travail.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Heure et date", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Vous utilisez la question<span class=\"italic\"> Quelle heure est-il ?</span> pour demander l'heure.  Vous pouvez utiliser <span class=\"italic\">\u00c0 quelle heure ... ?</span> pour demander des pr\u00e9cisions sur l'heure exacte d'un rendez-vous ou d'un \u00e9v\u00e9nement.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Vous utilisez les pr\u00e9positions <span class=\"strong\">\u00e0</span>,<span class=\"strong\"> dans</span>, et le d\u00e9terminant <span class=\"strong\">le</span> quand vous parlez d'une date et de l'heure.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Utilisez <span class=\"strong\">\u00e0</span> pour parler de l'heure :<span class=\"italic\"> \u00e0 10 heures, \u00e0 2 heures</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Utilisez <span class=\"strong\">dans</span> pour parler d'une dur\u00e9e :<span class=\"italic\"> dans 15 minutes, dans une heure </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Utilisez <span class=\"strong\">le</span> pour parler d'une date :<span class=\"italic\"> le 3 d\u00e9cembre, le 2 janvier </span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Demander, accepter ou refuser de l'aide", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Quand vous voulez de l'aide, voici comment vous pouvez le demander. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Quand une personne propose de vous aider, voici ce que vous pouvez dire : ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Demander de l'aide</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Accepter l'offre</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Refuser l'aide</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Pouvez-vous ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Merci. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Merci, mais \u00e7a devrait aller. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Pourriez-vous m'aider... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">C'est tr\u00e8s gentil de votre part !</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Je n'ai pas besoin d'aide. Merci.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Est-ce que je peux vous demander de ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Merci beaucoup pour l'offre !</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">J'appr\u00e9cie votre aide mais... </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">Georges</span> : Peux-tu m'aider \u00e0 m'entra\u00eener ? <br /><span class=\"strong\">Brigitte</span> : Absolument ! Voici des conseils utiles. <br /><span class=\"strong\">Georges</span> : C'est tr\u00e8s gentil de ta part !<br /> <span class=\"strong\">Brigitte</span> : Veux-tu que je prenne des notes ?<br /><span class=\"strong\">Georges</span> : J'appr\u00e9cie l'offre mais \u00e7a ira.</span>", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "pratiquer", "type": "name"}, {"content": "faire quelque chose de fa\u00e7on r\u00e9p\u00e9titive pour s'am\u00e9liorer", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Je pratique pour mon entretien.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le08ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "Voici des mots utilis\u00e9s quand vous pratiquez un entretien.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "le volontariat", "type": "name"}, {"content": "une personne qui fait du travail gratuitement", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Je fais du volontariat \u00e0 la biblioth\u00e8que.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le08ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "poli, polie", "type": "name"}, {"content": "\u00eatre respectueux", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjectif)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Ce petit gar\u00e7on est tr\u00e8s poli.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le08ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "coop\u00e9ratif, coop\u00e9rative", "type": "name"}, {"content": " bien travailler en groupe", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjectif)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : J'adore le travail en groupe. Je suis coop\u00e9ratif.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le08ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "sociable ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "aimer parler aux gens", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjectif)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Je suis une personne tr\u00e8s sociable.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le08ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "frn2le08ob05re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "\u00c9crivez un court dialogue (6-8 lignes). ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Racontez un probl\u00e8me. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Demandez de l'aide \u00e0 un ami. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Votre ami accepte de vous aider. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Entra\u00eenez-vous \u00e0 dire le dialogue \u00e0 voix haute. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "\u00c9changez les r\u00f4les. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "Je peux expliquer un probl\u00e8me \u00e0 un ami. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Je peux demander de l'aide \u00e0 un ami. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "J'accepte d'aider un ami. ", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "frn2le08ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "frn2le08ob05re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "frn2le08ob05re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "frn2le08ob05re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> :       H\u00e9 Pierre ! Est-ce que tu te sens pr\u00eat pour ton entretien ?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> :        Oui ! Je m'entra\u00eene en ce moment.", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "frn2le08ob05re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> :       Quand a lieu ton entretien ?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> :    C'est le 2 mai, dans la matin\u00e9e. Est-ce que tu peux m'aider ?", "time": "5800", "id": 2}, {"image": "frn2le08ob05re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> :      Aucun probl\u00e8me ! \u00c0 quelle heure est ton entretien ?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> : \u00c0 10 h 30", "time": "11000", "id": 3}, {"image": "frn2le08ob05re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> :      Ok, entra\u00eenons-nous ensemble.  Alors, M. Dupont, parlez-moi de vous ?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> :       C'est tr\u00e8s sympa de ta part, Charlotte. Merci ! Et bien je fais du volontariat, je suis tr\u00e8s poli et j'aime le travail en groupe.", "time": "17000", "id": 4}, {"image": "frn2le08ob05re2img03.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> :       Pourquoi ne dis-tu pas \u00e0 la place : \"je suis tr\u00e8s coop\u00e9ratif\".\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> :     D'accord, je suis bon avec les ordinateurs.", "time": "32000", "id": 5}, {"image": "frn2le08ob05re2img03.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> :       Humm. C'est mieux de dire : \"Je connais diff\u00e9rents logiciels\".\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> :      D'accord. J'aime aussi parler aux gens.", "time": "40000", "id": 6}, {"image": "frn2le08ob05re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> :       Dis : \"Je suis une personne tr\u00e8s sociable\". Veux-tu des exemples ?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> :      Non, merci. Je pense que c'est bon.", "time": "50000", "id": 7}]}}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Je peux donner l'heure et dire la date. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux demander, accepter ou refuser de l'aide.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux faire des recommandations.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Comment acceptez-vous de l'aide ? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Comment d\u00e9clinez-vous de l'aide ? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Demandez \u00e0 votre camarade :", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Quand a lieu l'entretien de Pierre&nbsp;?  Est-ce que Charlotte l'aide&nbsp;? ", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Charlotte aide Pierre \u00e0 pr\u00e9parer son entretien. Est-ce qu'il accepte ou refuse sa proposition ?", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attem